   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two options, it makes no difference",
     "texto": [
      "To say that one thing or another makes no difference, or that something is so whatever happens, use **-든(지)**: 가다 → **가든지 오든지** (whether (he/she) goes or comes), 먹다 → **먹든지 말든지** (whether (he/she) eats or not).",
      "가**든지** 말**든지** 상관없어요 = it makes no difference whether we go or not."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With question words",
     "texto": [
      "With **무엇, 언제, 누구, 어디** **-(이)든지** is used, meaning «whatever», «whenever», «whoever»: 무엇**이든지** = whatever it is, 언제**든지** = whenever.",
      "언제**든지** 말해 주세요 = please tell me whenever."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
